{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"05c12c83ff38d24712f25654cc89cfdbd41efee1c9ae27433c32998b7b2dcdc6","ja":"高い食材がなくても","zh":"即使没有昂贵的食材","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a5da921a92fb1a9b3cd8aea83b8e31ddad3ac78b40ecd99c1d23c517bc13570c","ja":"おそばの準備は完了っと♪\n具材の方はどうですか？","zh":"荞麦面准备好啦♪\n配料那边准备得怎么样了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0db8aa2b46c5428664af3530aeb49938cf690a85bb91ee11631e6520ea778a13","ja":"へへっ、バッチリだぜ！\nミンチに味付けして、棒状にして揚げてみたんだー。","zh":"嘿嘿，万无一失！\n我把肉馅调了味，做成棒状炸了一下哦——","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ed2021f29c88958d056a77622b5f2b3873ed550467908e9a9f6902fc33950078","ja":"名付けて、バット天ぷら！　これで来年も元気に\nホームランをかっとばせそうだろ♪","zh":"命名为，球棒天妇罗！这样明年感觉也能精神满满地\n击出全垒打了对吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b015d452f62dd811353a80b303105ca55028085f3ef7df0349b943cba31b024a","ja":"私はこれだよ……じゃじゃーん♪","zh":"我选这个哦……锵锵～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8da6953881ac934d1fabfde1810e23c4423af7a949d80673e95affd08ca94226","ja":"かまぼこをいろんな形に切ったんですね。\nハートとか、星とか……えーっと、これは……？","zh":"把鱼糕切成了各种形状呢。\n有爱心、星星……呃，这个是……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8ef7298a5d10fa4039962a3e20534eb424b47b2e585415e0ae5bb83d6c1467ad","ja":"でんでんむす君だよ♪\n色んな形がある方が、楽しく食べられるよねっ♪","zh":"这是蜗牛饭团君哦♪\n有各种各样的形状，吃起来才更有趣嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"bfdf120169d1a039ac6ec788dcd307ed1cc890453b8c5d8ed05b4cb6bb50fc35","ja":"美奈子ちゃんは、ずっとお鍋と格闘してたけど、\nおつゆはできた？","zh":"美奈子一直在跟锅奋战呢，\n汤做好了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f020aa9f45a6c7cb0fd8e4704779c60732403b397b943912beae1d2ad97eb5af","ja":"はい、出汁を工夫して、\n栄養いっぱいの特製そばつゆを作りました♪","zh":"好的，我在高汤上下了番功夫，\n做成了营养丰富的特制荞麦面酱汁♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e475f1481a50296e67d675ca4d7d093f137fc1bb9fc72c53e5b28108a9b00b32","ja":"わあ～、すっごくいい匂い♪\nとっても美味しそうだね♪","zh":"哇～，好香啊♪\n看起来非常美味呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"631d37d6fca51884627267cd6336f18a502e9f0ed43f1156ef79c10043f76080","ja":"あっ、そろそろ\n●●●●プロデューサーが帰ってくる時間だぜ！","zh":"啊，差不多到了\n●●●●制作人回来的时间了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"010c52ac599574ef76dc3f9989c6e7ae8e4df9cf6ee6936f6bf0f266b08a21e3","ja":"急いで仕上げなきゃ！　湯がいていたおそばを\nそばつゆに入れて……。昴ちゃん、具材乗せて！","zh":"得赶快做好了！把焯好的荞麦面\n盛进面汤里……。昴，快把配料放上去！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"0e1ec5bd24c6a2ed521a0b45e2771abdf2a23eb27d7906f82a540847fd05676a","ja":"OK！　おそばにバット天ぷらをズバッと\n差し込んで、麗花のかまぼこを乗せて……。","zh":"OK！往荞麦面里啪地一下插上球棒天妇罗，\n再放上丽花的鱼糕……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7f052118edeb73f4719cd1933b14935fe307149adc7042a67583639931285d32","ja":"はい、完成♪　あとは、●●●●プロデューサーさんを\n待つだけ……って、もう来ちゃう！？","zh":"好啦，完成♪　接下来就只等\n●●●●制作人先生了……等等，这就来了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6cb3e8961fea0a2a55f0cba552dd053bd85d4429974c5c494c1e424749f13ea9","ja":"うん。この足音は……きっと、\n●●●●プロデューサーさんだね。　","zh":"嗯。这脚步声……一定是\n●●●●制作人吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4e68dff69f57aa4e67353ba5860431083c570a8c471c4345094e06331bed42fd","ja":"よーし、きたきた……それじゃあ\nみんなでいくぜ！　せーのっ！","zh":"好——来了来了……那么\n大家一起上吧！预备——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1346.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"1a3dceceb044a9aa03894c44c987e115efe3fcd5a573552d8234e04b2a080946","ja":"「おかえりなさい！　今年もお疲れ様でした！」","zh":"“欢迎回来！今年也辛苦了！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
